id: pm-rcjyft
title: Keep merge driver launchers usable after runtime upgrades
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1248. Installed drivers use a stable runtime launcher when available; missing executables report an actionable pm merge install recovery; real branch merge remains intact after runtime upgrade simulation."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-12T21:08:33.294Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-22T05:06:34.610Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-16T12:25:18.837Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-16T12:25:18.837Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Installed drivers use a stable runtime launcher when available; missing executables report an actionable pm merge install recovery; real branch merge remains intact after runtime upgrade simulation.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Keep merge driver launchers usable after runtime upgrades
value: Reliable privacy-preserving operational context for agents and package consumers
parent: pm-o2kc
resolution: The SDK retains an absolute identity-checked runtime launcher and diagnostics recommend pm merge install when configuration is missing or drifted.
expected_result: Git merge drivers remain usable after a versioned runtime is removed when its stable launcher remains available; otherwise diagnosis gives a concrete repair.
actual_result: A real Git merge succeeds after old-runtime removal and launcher retargeting; focused and full 8897-test suites pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage.
