comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-12T21:08:33.294Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete CLI full all-status export on 2026-09-12 contained 2745 items with no omissions. Request-specific telemetry and onboarding searches plus exact GitHub URL and title/description matching found no owner for this distinct report. Existing parent and closed implementation lineage reused."
  "2026-09-12T21:08:52.640Z","harness:codex","GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1248. Canonical tracking reused after complete all-status duplicate check."
  "2026-09-16T11:43:13.523Z","harness:codex","Scope evidence: reviewed the complete 2762-item all-status inventory and canonical closed pm-w91mvg lineage. Current installer quotes process.execPath directly, which preserves versioned runtime paths. Implement an absolute PATH launcher only when its realpath matches the executing runtime; keep pinned fallback and package identity checks. Add deterministic runtime-upgrade and real Git merge regressions, plus shared health/validate recovery."
  "2026-09-16T11:52:05.313Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: both new tests failed before implementation (stable launcher selection and health remediation). After the fix, 12 focused tests passed; the additional real Git test passed after copying a runtime, installing through a stable symlink, deleting the old runtime directory, retargeting the symlink and merging independent JSON changes. No repository tracker data was used by these tests."
  "2026-09-16T12:08:21.429Z","harness:codex","Full-suite integration corrections: existing init asserts runtime file identity rather than a versioned path spelling; storage validation now expects the executable merge-install recovery hint. Moved launcher regressions into the merge test domain to preserve the existing directory fanout limit. Focused 65 tests across five suites pass; no thresholds were weakened."
  "2026-09-16T12:12:06.125Z","harness:codex","Live observability and supply-chain verification 2026-09-16: no open Dependabot/code-scanning/secret-scanning alerts; dependency audit clean. Sentry authenticated 14-day threshold query returned critical=0/high=0; telemetry aggregate error rate 1.35 percent and no failure rows missing error codes. Explicit telemetry flush drained one queued event to zero with a current successful-flush timestamp. These are separate from application correctness and do not assert every historical user event was delivered."
  "2026-09-16T12:25:16.641Z","harness:codex","Verification: 697 files and 8897 tests passed in the complete isolated suite. Exact V8 coverage: statements 64604/64604; branches 49259/49259; functions 13416/13416; lines 61855/61855. All four metrics are 100 percent with zero uncovered counts. Typecheck, linked tests, docs links, secret scan and dependency audit pass. Real runtime removal/retargeting still permits a conflict-free merge."
